    {
      "key": "teef59d6b69b3f577",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Is it normal to lose money as a beginner forex trader?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/top-10-mistakes-new-forex-traders-make#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/top-10-mistakes-new-forex-traders-make"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">É normal perder dinheiro como trader iniciante de forex?</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t50fd8e61e66e0417",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Losing trades are normal, including for experienced participants. However, repeated losses caused by excessive leverage, missing stop-losses, or impulsive decisions should not be treated as an unavoidable learning fee. Beginners should practise and review mistakes before increasing exposure.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/top-10-mistakes-new-forex-traders-make#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/top-10-mistakes-new-forex-traders-make"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Perder negócios é normal, inclusive para participantes experientes. No entanto, perdas repetidas causadas por alavancagem excessiva, paradas perdidas, ou decisões impulsivas não devem ser tratadas como uma taxa de aprendizado inevitável. Iniciantes devem praticar e rever erros antes de aumentar a exposição.</span>"
    },
