      "key": "tee218f8f98878229",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Review drawdown, trade count, costs, consecutive losses, and whether results depend on a few unusual trades. Data quality, spreads, slippage, modelling choices, and over-optimisation can distort a backtest.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
